# Cross-field invariants (your output WILL be rejected if any is violated)

1. If primary_label == "Aligned": findings is empty, edit_plan is null,
   page_summary.should_focus_on is null, suggested_action is "KEEP".
2. If suggested_action ∈ {"UPDATE","REWRITE"}: edit_plan is non-null AND
   findings has ≥1 item.
3. If suggested_action == "DELETE": findings has ≥1 item AND edit_plan is null.
4. If suggested_action == "MANUAL_REVIEW": confidence < 0.6.
5. Every finding.quoted_text MUST be a literal substring of the page body
   provided below. Do not paraphrase. Do not summarize. Quote exactly.
6. Every affected_prompts entry must match an id from the PROMPTS list.

